ntlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/bf02d1ecca9b5392.js?dpl=dpl_BA6MA1iuxHYYGvNsMBA3Cfie8fdr\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/131ccaa6860e9a4d.js?dpl=dpl_BA6MA1iuxHYYGvNsMBA3Cfie8fdr\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/8e9337ad3691af99.js?dpl=dpl_BA6MA1iuxHYYGvNsMBA3Cfie8fdr\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/0f09e481a30b277f.js?dpl=dpl_BA6MA1iuxHYYGvNsMBA3Cfie8fdr\"],\"ScopedNavProvider\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"43:T5b9,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"General Translation: General Translation API provides large model-based multilingual translation services, including general translation, paraphrase translation, two-step translation, and three-pass translation strategies. It supports automatic language detection, glossary customization, translation suggestions, and streaming output. Users only need to call the Translation API, input the text to be processed, specify the source language (auto-detection supported) and target language to receive high-quality translation results. \n\n Popular Special Effects Videos: Popular special effects videos are intelligent templates launched based on trending features from pan-entertainment platforms, designed to precisely adapt to short video creative production needs. Currently, three effect templates are available: `French Kiss`, `Body Shake Dance`, and `Sexy Me`. After selecting a template, users only need to upload an image and enter corresponding prompts to generate a special effects video. \n\n GLM Slide/Poster Agent: An intelligent creation agent built for working people and creators. It goes beyond traditional engineering-style assembly tools—supporting one-click generation of slides or posters from natural language instructions. By natively integrating content generation with layout aesthetics and design conventions, it helps you quickly produce polished, professional-grade materials while lowering design barriers and boosting creative efficiency."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"19:[\"$\",\"$L42\",null,{\"scopedNav\":{\"global\":null,\"versions\":[{\"version\":\"English\",\"tabs\":[{\"tab\":\"Guides\",\"groups\":[{\"group\":\"Get Started\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Quick Start\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/overview/quick-start\"},{\"title\":\"Overview\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/overview/overview\"},{\"title\":\"Pricing\",\"description\":\"This page provides pricing information for Z.AI’s models and tools. All prices are in USD.\",\"href\":\"/guides/overview/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Core Parameters\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/overview/concept-param\"},{\"group\":\"SDKs Guide\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"HTTP API Calls\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/develop/http/introduction\"},{\"title\":\"Official Python SDK\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/develop/python/introduction\"},{\"title\":\"Official Java SDK\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/develop/java/introduction\"},{\"title\":\"OpenAI Python SDK\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/develop/openai/python\"},{\"title\":\"LangChain Integration\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/develop/langchain/introduction\"}]},{\"title\":\"Migrate to GLM-5.3\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/overview/migrate-to-glm-new\"}]},{\"group\":\"Models\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"GLM-5.3-Flash\",\"tag\":\"New\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/vlm/glm-5.3-flash\"},{\"title\":\"GLM-5.3\",\"tag\":\"Hot\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/llm/glm-5.3\"},{\"title\":\"GLM-5.2\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/llm/glm-5.2\"},{\"title\":\"GLM-OCR\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/vlm/glm-ocr\"},{\"title\":\"GLM-ASR-2512\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/audio/glm-asr-2512\"}]},{\"group\":\"Capabilities\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Thinking Mode\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/capabilities/thinking-mode\"},{\"title\":\"Deep Thinking\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/capabilities/thinking\"},{\"title\":\"Streaming Messages\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/capabilities/streaming\"},{\"title\":\"Tool Streaming Output\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/capabilities/stream-tool\"},{\"title\":\"Function Calling\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/capabilities/function-calling\"},{\"title\":\"Context Caching\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/capabilities/cache\"},{\"title\":\"Structured Output\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/capabilities/struct-output\"}]},{\"group\":\"Tools\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Web Search\",\"keywords\":[\"Z.AI\",\"web search\"],\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/tools/web-search\"},{\"title\":\"Stream Tool Call\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/tools/stream-tool\"}]},{\"group\":\"Agents\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"GLM Slide/Poster Agent(beta)\",\"description\":\"A Slide \u0026 Poster Agent powered by the native capabilities of the GLM model — integrating information retrieval, content structuring, and visual layout design, enabling you to effortlessly create professional-grade slides and posters.\",\"href\":\"/guides/agents/slide\"},{\"title\":\"Translation Agent\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/agents/translation\"},{\"title\":\"Video Effect Template Agent\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/guides/agents/video-template\"}]}]},{\"tab\":\"API Reference\",\"groups\":[{\"group\":\"Using the APIs\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Introduction\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/api-reference/introduction\"},{\"title\":\"Errors\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/api-reference/api-code\"},{\"title\":\"Rate Limits\",\"url\":\"https://z.ai/manage-apikey/rate-limits\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/api-reference/rate-limit\"}]},{\"group\":\"Model API\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Chat Completion\",\"openapi\":\"POST /paas/v4/chat/completions\",\"description\":\"Create a chat completion model that generates AI replies for given conversation messages. It supports multimodal inputs (text, images, audio, video, file), offers configurable parameters (like temperature, max tokens, tool use), and supports both streaming and non-streaming output modes.\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/llm/chat-completion\"}]},{\"group\":\"Image API\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Generate Image\",\"openapi\":\"POST /paas/v4/images/generations\",\"description\":\"Use [GLM-Image](/guides/image/glm-image) series models to generate high-quality images from text prompts. Through quick and accurate understanding of user text descriptions, `AI` image expression becomes more precise and personalized.\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/image/generate-image\"},{\"title\":\"Generate Image(Async)\",\"openapi\":\"POST /paas/v4/async/images/generations\",\"description\":\"Use the [GLM-Image](/guides/image/glm-image) series models to generate high-quality images from text prompts. Through quick and accurate understanding of user text descriptions, `AI` image expression becomes more precise and personalized. Only supports `GLM-Image` model.\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/image/generate-image-async\"},{\"title\":\"Retrieve Result\",\"openapi\":\"GET /paas/v4/async-result/{id}\",\"description\":\"This endpoint is used to query the result of an asynchronous request.\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/image/get-image-status\"}]},{\"group\":\"Video API\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Generate Video(Async)\",\"openapi\":\"POST /paas/v4/videos/generations\",\"description\":\"CogVideoX is a video generation large model developed by Z.AI, equipped with powerful video generation capabilities. Simply inputting text or images allows for effortless video creation.\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/video/generate-video\"},{\"title\":\"Retrieve Result\",\"openapi\":\"GET /paas/v4/async-result/{id}\",\"description\":\"This endpoint is used to query the result of an asynchronous request.\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/video/get-video-status\"}]},{\"group\":\"Audio API\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Audio Transcriptions\",\"openapi\":\"POST /paas/v4/audio/transcriptions\",\"description\":\"Use the [GLM-ASR-2512](/guides/audio/glm-asr-2512) model to transcribe audio files into text, supporting multiple languages and real-time streaming transcription.\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/audio/audio-transcriptions\"}]},{\"group\":\"Tool API\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Tokenizer\",\"openapi\":\"POST /paas/v4/tokenizer\",\"description\":\"`Tokenizer` is used to split text into `tokens` recognizable by the model and calculate the count. It receives user input text, processes it through the model for tokenization, and finally returns the corresponding `token` count. It is suitable for text length evaluation, model input estimation, dialogue context truncation, cost calculation, etc.\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/tools/tokenizer\"},{\"title\":\"Layout Parsing\",\"openapi\":\"POST /paas/v4/layout_parsing\",\"description\":\"Use the [GLM-OCR](/guides/vlm/glm-ocr) model to parse the layout of documents and images and extract text content. Support OCR recognition of images and PDF documents, returning detailed layout information and visualization results.\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/tools/layout-parsing\"},{\"title\":\"Web Search\",\"openapi\":\"POST /paas/v4/web_search\",\"description\":\"The [Web Search](/guides/tools/web-search) is a specialized search engine for large language models. Building upon traditional search engine capabilities like web crawling and ranking, it enhances intent recognition to return results better suited for LLM processing (including webpage titles, URLs, summaries, site names, favicons etc.).\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/tools/web-search\"},{\"title\":\"Web Reader\",\"openapi\":\"POST /paas/v4/reader\",\"description\":\"Reads and parses the content of the specified URL. Supports selectable return formats, cache control, image retention, and summary options.\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/tools/web-reader\"}]},{\"group\":\"Agent API\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Agent Chat\",\"openapi\":\"POST /v1/agents\",\"description\":\"$43\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/agents/agent\"},{\"title\":\"File Upload\",\"openapi\":\"POST /paas/v4/files\",\"description\":\"This API is designed for uploading auxiliary files (such as glossaries, terminology lists) to support the translation service. It allows users to upload reference materials that can enhance translation accuracy and consistency.\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/agents/file-upload\"},{\"title\":\"Retrieve Result\",\"openapi\":\"POST /v1/agents/async-result\",\"description\":\"This endpoint is used to query the result of an asynchronous request.\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/agents/get-async-result\"},{\"title\":\"Conversation History\",\"openapi\":\"POST /v1/agents/conversation\",\"description\":\"This endpoint is used to query the agent conversation history.Only support slides_glm_agent\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/agents/agent-conversation\"}]}]},{\"tab\":\"Coding Plan\",\"pages\":[{\"group\":\"GLM Coding Plan\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Overview\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/overview\"},{\"title\":\"Usage Policy\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/usage-policy\"},{\"title\":\"FAQ\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/faq\"},{\"title\":\"Team Plan Benefits\",\"description\":\"Learn about GLM Coding Team Plan usage quotas, benefits, and usage rules\",\"href\":\"/devpack/teamplan\"}]},{\"group\":\"Guide\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Quick Start\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/quick-start\"},{\"title\":\"Coding Tool Helper\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/extension/coding-tool-helper\"},{\"title\":\"Tool Integration\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/tool/others\"},{\"title\":\"How to Switch Models\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/latest-model\"},{\"group\":\"MCP Integration\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Vision MCP Server\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/mcp/vision-mcp-server\"},{\"title\":\"Web Search MCP Server\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/mcp/search-mcp-server\"},{\"title\":\"Web Reader MCP Server\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/mcp/reader-mcp-server\"},{\"title\":\"Zread MCP Server\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/mcp/zread-mcp-server\"}]}]},{\"group\":\"Notice\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"GLM-5.3-Flash Usage Campaign\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/notice/event-glm-5.3-flash\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Update Announcement\",\"description\":\"This notice explains the plan update, how your current benefits are protected, and what happens to future subscriptions.\",\"href\":\"/devpack/notice/usage-revision\"},{\"title\":\"Legacy Plan Migration Notice\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/transition\"}]},{\"group\":\"Learning Resources\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Best Practice\",\"description\":\"Best Practices for Coding Agents: Managing Prompts, Plans, Skills, and Workflows\",\"href\":\"/devpack/resources/best-practice\"},{\"title\":\"Memory-mechanism\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/resources/memory-mechanism\"}]},{\"group\":\"Campaign Rules\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Invite Friends, Get Credits\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/devpack/credit-campaign-rules\"}]}]},{\"tab\":\"Released Notes\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"New Released\",\"description\":\"Follow along with updates across Z.AI’s models\",\"href\":\"/release-notes/new-released\"}]},{\"tab\":\"Terms and Policy\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/legal-agreement/privacy-policy\"},{\"title\":\"Terms of Use\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/legal-agreement/terms-of-use\"},{\"title\":\"Subscriptions, Fees, and Payment\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/legal-agreement/subscription-terms\"}]},{\"tab\":\"Help Center\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"FAQ\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/help/faq\"}]}]}]},\"maps\":{\"firstHrefInVersion\":{\"English\":{\"href\":\"/guides/llm/glm-5.1\",\"matchLevel\":0}},\"firstHrefInLanguage\":{}},\"children\":\"$L44\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"45:I[